1
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,520
(The Song family is complicated.)

2
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:34,520
(I can't rely on Song Cheng alone)

3
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,400
(to keep my place in this family.)

4
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,360
(I can only rely on myself.)

5
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,120
(Leaving now)

6
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,920
(is so I can come back stronger.)

7
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:42,920
(This is)

8
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:44,920
(only the beginning.)

9
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,640
I underestimated you.

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,720
You're the first person

11
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:56,400
the Song family kicked out

12
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,120
who actually came back.

13
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:01,640
What spell did you cast on
Ms. Song Cheng?

14
00:01:01,640 --> 00:01:02,640
Last night,

15
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,800
she had a huge fight with Mr. Song.

16
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:05,720
She cried and screamed,

17
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:06,800
begging for you to come back.

18
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,440
She had a fever all night.

19
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:11,720
Ms. Chen, you sure have quite a way

20
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:13,040
of exaggerating things.

21
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:29,320
Ms. Song Cheng.

22
00:01:31,860 --> 00:01:36,980
=Dear Song=

23
00:01:37,060 --> 00:01:39,380
=Episode 11=
(The Trap Closes)

24
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:46,840
What are you looking for?

25
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,640
Nothing.

26
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,320
You must be hungry.

27
00:01:51,520 --> 00:01:52,320
I'll go cook.

28
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,480
Song Huaishan wouldn't do this to you.

29
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,640
Who did it?

30
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:01,600
Nothing.

31
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:02,760
I was just careless.

32
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,720
Jing.

33
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:06,200
No one's more careful than you.

34
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,720
What really happened?

35
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:09,760
Nothing.

36
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:10,400
Drop it.

37
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,560
It's Zhao Hui,

38
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,200
right?

39
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:19,460
(GangA 88555)

40
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,080
Jing.

41
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,680
Take Mr. Song's bag.

42
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,160
Okay.

43
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,200
Go tell Yu Song,

44
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,320
if I still don't get what I want,

45
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:33,440
you won't have it easy either.

46
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:35,120
What do you mean?

47
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:44,800
Song Lin hasn't divorced him,

48
00:02:45,160 --> 00:02:46,760
but she's cut him off financially.

49
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,640
Now he's no different from

50
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,400
a cornered madman.

51
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,800
My injury is nothing.

52
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,200
I'm just worried

53
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,000
he might do something to hurt you.

54
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:02,480
Song.

55
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,600
I want to be your weapon,

56
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:06,120
not your burden.

57
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:08,720
Zhao Hui's desperate now.

58
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,920
He could break his legs

59
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,320
and still not escape the Song family.

60
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,320
Don't get it wet for the next two days.

61
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:18,600
I'll cook.

62
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,000
What's so funny?

63
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:35,240
Did you hit your head or something?

64
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,160
I'm just happy.

65
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:39,800
You still care about me.

66
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,920
You've been focused on
Song Cheng lately.

67
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,480
I thought...

68
00:03:44,880 --> 00:03:45,520
You didn't...

69
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,520
How childish.

70
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:50,040
Jealous of a little girl.

71
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,520
Only with you.

72
00:04:00,720 --> 00:04:02,000
If Zhao Hui wants it,

73
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,120
let's give it to him.

74
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:06,840
See if he can handle it.

75
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,040
The project proposal

76
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:10,040
isn't at home.

77
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,400
It must be in Song Huan's office.

78
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:19,740
(Song Group)

79
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,280
(Back then,)

80
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:39,880
(my biggest ambition)

81
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,520
(was to get a desk here.)

82
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,720
(But real ambition)

83
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:46,680
(is never to be a good pawn,)

84
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:50,480
(but to control the whole board.)

85
00:04:53,180 --> 00:04:55,400
(Product Director)

86
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,320
Ms. Yu.

87
00:05:00,560 --> 00:05:01,560
Mr. Zhao.

88
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:03,440
I'm bringing porridge to Ms. Song Huan.

89
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,440
I'll take you.

90
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,520
Looks like Jing delivered the message.

91
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:14,640
I'll find a way to get Song Huan out.

92
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,160
You do your part.

93
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,800
Once it's done,

94
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,960
we're even.

95
00:05:22,400 --> 00:05:24,000
Her office is right ahead.

96
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,320
Ms. Yu.

97
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,520
Good luck.

98
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:51,420
(Hot Spring Project)

99
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:57,440
(Hot Spring Project Proposal)

100
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,840
Who let you in?

101
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,800
Sorry, Ms. Song Huan.

102
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,720
Ms. Chen asked me to bring you porridge.

103
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,040
I didn't want to delay your meal,

104
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:10,440
so I came right in.

105
00:06:33,980 --> 00:06:36,660
(Song Group)

106
00:06:38,700 --> 00:06:40,620
(Song Group)

107
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:53,560
Give me the proposal.

108
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,040
Pay me a million first.

109
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:59,280
I knew you were greedy and ruthless.

110
00:06:59,840 --> 00:07:00,760
Don't forget,

111
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:03,840
you're the one who snuck in to steal it.

112
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,680
And now you're the one
handing it over to me.

113
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,280
Mr. Zhao.

114
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,960
Are you using me and tossing me aside?

115
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,240
So what?

116
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:15,440
You stole trade secrets.
That's a serious crime.

117
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,160
You're just a maid.

118
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:19,080
What leverage do you have?

119
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,840
What's so funny?

120
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:35,880
Zhao Hui.

121
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,080
You stole trade secrets.

122
00:07:38,400 --> 00:07:40,760
I'm suing you on behalf of Song Group.

123
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,120
Impossible.

124
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:43,280
You should be...

125
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:46,640
Ms. Song Huan.

126
00:07:46,640 --> 00:07:48,160
The project team needs you
for something urgent.

127
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:55,080
Time to spring the trap.

128
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:58,480
That medicine you sent works wonders.

129
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,600
Better than porridge.

130
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,960
You two teamed up to trick me!

131
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,200
Yu Song.

132
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,720
How much did Song Huan pay you?

133
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:15,920
How dare you betray me?

134
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:16,960
Mr. Zhao.

135
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,280
When did we ever work together?

136
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:22,320
Stealing trade secrets
is a serious crime.

137
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:23,920
I don't want to go to jail.

138
00:08:24,960 --> 00:08:26,160
Why don't you take a look

139
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,480
at what you just took?

140
00:08:31,980 --> 00:08:33,420
(Hot Spring Project Proposal)

141
00:08:33,420 --> 00:08:34,540
(You lose, loser.)

142
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:40,460
(You lose, loser.)

143
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:43,520
How did this happen?

144
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,960
If that's not enough,

145
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:47,920
here's more.

146
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:50,540
(You lose, loser.)

147
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:57,680
It was my plan. So what?

148
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:59,920
If you hadn't swooped in,

149
00:08:59,920 --> 00:09:02,320
the hot spring project
should've been mine!

150
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,680
I took it from you.

151
00:09:04,680 --> 00:09:06,080
It's not yours anymore.

152
00:09:06,400 --> 00:09:07,720
Song Huan.

153
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:10,080
You witch!

154
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,520
You think you've won?

155
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:12,720
Yu Song.

156
00:09:12,920 --> 00:09:14,520
She's a liar.

157
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:16,280
Everything about her is fake.

158
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,880
Don't think she really
wants to join your side.

159
00:09:18,880 --> 00:09:21,440
She wants to bleed the Song family dry
even more than I do.

160
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:23,160
Take him away.

161
00:09:23,680 --> 00:09:24,560
(Security)
Song Huan!

162
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:27,160
Song Lin won't let you get away with it.

163
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:27,760
Perfect.

164
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:30,000
I'd like to see

165
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,560
what Song Lin has to say to me
this time.

166
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:33,960
Take him.

167
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,960
A liar with only a high school diploma.

168
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,960
I admire what you bring to the table.
